@startuml
title Features: Content & Promotions Engine
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
autonumber

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "Browser (Vue UI)" as Browser
participant "Laravel (BFF)" as BFF
participant "Content Service" as CMS
participant "ERP/Pricing Engine" as ERP
participant "Redis Cache" as Cache
actor "Standard User" as User

== Feature 9: Ospedaliero Import ==

Admin -> Browser: Upload "Listino Ospedaliero"
Browser -> BFF: POST /admin/import/ospedaliero (Multipart)
BFF -> ERP: Stream CSV File Data
ERP -> ERP: Async validation & Upsert Prices
ERP -> BFF: Job queued response
BFF -> Browser: Import in progress

== Feature 24, 25: Services Area & News Mgmt ==

Admin -> Browser: Create new Formative Video/News
Browser -> BFF: POST /admin/content
BFF -> CMS: Create Article/Media Blob
CMS -> BFF: Content Created
BFF -> Cache: Invalidate Content Cache
BFF -> Browser: Success

== Feature 27, 28, 29: Promotions & Ad Placements ==

Admin -> Browser: Configure Ad Space (Spazi promozionali)
note left of Browser: Feature 27 & 29
Browser -> BFF: POST /admin/ads
BFF -> CMS: Configure Ad Slot visibility & Target Links

note over BFF, ERP: Feature 28: Phase 2 - Dynamic Pricing Sync
BFF -> ERP: POST /admin/pricing/overrides (Gestione Pricing x Cliente)
ERP -> ERP: Apply Discount Matrix

User -> Browser: Access Dashboard
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/dashboard
BFF -> Cache: Check Cache
Cache -> BFF: Cached Banners/Ads (from CMS) & Formative contents
BFF -> ERP: Retrieve real-time personalized pricing
BFF -> Browser: Render Dashboard (Ads, Formative Material, Prices)

@enduml
